# Line endings are LF in the repository and in every checkout, Windows included.
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which would check out the hook
# scripts with CRLF — and bash then fails on "$'\r': command not found" in a hook
# nobody watches. A marketplace install on Windows is such a checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
